gfx906-rccl-topology (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. gfx906-rccl-topology.service writes the RCCL topology
    for the XGMI ring of the gfx906 GPUs to
    /var/cache/gfx906-rccl-topology/topology.xml on every boot, derived from
    the PCI tree and KFD's hives; /etc/rccl.conf points RCCL at it.
  * Mac Pro 7,1: physical ring instead of the firmware's swapped bridge
    links (all-reduce 34.1 vs 24.8 GB/s, four dies, 1 GiB).
  * On failure nothing is written and the previous file is renamed to
    .stale; removing the package deletes the generated file.

 -- Exabit Networks <packages@exabit.io>  Fri, 06 Nov 2026 14:00:00 +0000
